sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant Operator as ModelRegistryReconciler<br/>controller-manager
    participant IngressCfg as OpenShift Ingress Config<br/>config.openshift.io/v1
    participant RestDeploy as Registry Deployment<br/>rest-container + kube-rbac-proxy
    participant PostgresDeploy as PostgreSQL Deployment<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>TLS
    participant HTTPRoute as Gateway API HTTPRoute<br/>data-science-gateway

    Note over User,HTTPRoute: Flow 1: CR-to-Workload Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply ModelRegistry CR<br/>(v1alpha1 or v1beta1)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate + Mutate<br/>POST /validate-..., /mutate-...
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created/updated

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: ModelRegistry CR
    Operator->>IngressCfg: GET config.openshift.io/v1/Ingress<br/>Discover cluster domain
    IngressCfg-->>Operator: apps domain

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>{registry-name}
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Role + RoleBinding<br/>registry-user-{registry-name}
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Secret<br/>{registry-name}-postgres-credentials
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Secret<br/>{registry-name}-kube-rbac-proxy (TLS)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>{registry-name}-postgres
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>{registry-name}-postgres (5432/TCP)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>{registry-name} (rest + kube-rbac-proxy)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>{registry-name} (8080, 8443/TCP)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Route<br/>{registry-name}-https
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>model-registry-{registry-name}

    Note over User,HTTPRoute: Flow 2: Data-Plane Ingress (via Route)

    participant Client as External Client
    participant KubeRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RestAPI as REST Container<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Client->>Route: GET /api/model_registry/...<br/>HTTPS TLS<br/>Bearer Token
    Route->>KubeRBAC: Forward to 8443/TCP<br/>TLS
    KubeRBAC->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>services:get on {registry-name}
    K8sAPI-->>KubeRBAC: Allowed / Denied
    alt Authorized
        KubeRBAC->>RestAPI: Proxy to 8080/TCP<br/>HTTP
        RestAPI->>PostgresDeploy: SQL query<br/>5432/TCP
        PostgresDeploy-->>RestAPI: Query result
        RestAPI-->>KubeRBAC: JSON response
        KubeRBAC-->>Route: Encrypted response
        Route-->>Client: JSON response
    else Denied
        KubeRBAC-->>Route: 403 Forbidden
        Route-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end

    Note over User,HTTPRoute: Flow 3: Data-Plane Ingress (via Gateway API)

    Client->>HTTPRoute: GET /api/model_registry/...<br/>via data-science-gateway
    HTTPRoute->>KubeRBAC: Forward to 8443/TCP
    KubeRBAC->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KubeRBAC: Allowed
    KubeRBAC->>RestAPI: Proxy to 8080/TCP
    RestAPI-->>KubeRBAC: JSON response
    KubeRBAC-->>HTTPRoute: Response
    HTTPRoute-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over User,HTTPRoute: Flow 4: CRD Version Migration

    participant SVM as SVMStrategy
    participant MigrationRes as StorageVersionMigration<br/>migration.k8s.io

    Operator->>SVM: Detect v1alpha1 CRs
    SVM->>K8sAPI: Create StorageVersionMigration<br/>v1alpha1 → v1beta1
    K8sAPI->>MigrationRes: Execute migration
    MigrationRes-->>K8sAPI: Migration complete
    K8sAPI-->>SVM: Status update
